{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"28","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. pSort"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cells of some array decided to play the following game. Initially each cell contains a number which is equal to it's ordinal number (starting from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Also each cell determined it's favourite number. On it's move "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cell can exchange it's value with the value of some other "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cell, if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|i - j| = di"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"di"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a favourite number of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th cell. Cells make moves in any order, the number of moves is unlimited."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The favourite number of each cell will be given to you. You will also be given a permutation of numbers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". You are to determine whether the game could move to this state."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"